        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s strength path dao marks raise giant hand’s power by twenty percent. Wisdom path Gu Immortal inheritors likewise amplify star thought Immortal Gu through their own wisdom path dao marks, and ordinary experts can reach far higher multiples as their mark counts grow with stronger tribulations.",
